Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 19:14:50 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Skip work whose results are never used; outputs unchanged

- first run: tracked aircraft get a box-only update; their motion analysis (optical flow, MobileSAM masks, stage counters) was never read
- aircraft tracker: no FAST/ORB features (the feature check never received an image)
- second run: no unused float32 GPU copy of every frame; the retired YOLOv5 entity detector is no longer loaded
- camera classifier: no ImageNet download before loading its checkpoint
- heads: upload uint8 and convert on the GPU, share the 1088 preprocessing between GM and vehicle, no clone, one host copy of the detections
- per-frame printouts only with GM_VERBOSE=1
